#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Sure. I'll be there.
msgctxt "12012_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, it probably doesn't matter. Just having you there will help me relax."
msgstr "Bueno, Seguramente no importe. Con tenerte por ahí me ayudará a relajarme."

