msgstr "Oh, ya veo."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=119
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T119.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=譛帶怦莠ｬ蟄撰ｼ壽ｺ先ｰ丞錐
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "17724_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "There's no point in agonizing over it when I can't write, is there? It's better to just go to bed."
msgstr ""

